---
/**
 * The footer is one quiet mono line: "Last visit from" is rendered on the
 * server; only the location fills in after load, scrambling in from
 * /api/last-visit and again whenever it changes. The line hides only if
 * the request fails.
 */
---

<footer class="site-frame mt-24 pb-10 font-mono text-xs text-foreground-soft">
  <p x-data="lastVisit" class="min-h-4" x-show="!failed">
    Last visit from <span x-text="label"></span>
  </p>
</footer>
